-- stdin
We follow Smith et al. Their method is faster. This extends Kingma et al. We borrow the implementation.

Smith et al. (2020) show that it converges. Smith et al. 2020 report the same result. Smith et al. showed that it converges. Smith et al. [3] agree. As shown by Smith et al., the method converges.

We use the Vaswani et al\. Transformer architecture. Vaswani et al. Curran Associates, Inc. 2017.

